# 软件引用卡（GitHub「Cite this repository」据此生成 BibTeX）。
# 抢先版阶段：version 与 date-released 随每次发布同步更新。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use loadn in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
title: loadn
type: software
authors:
  - name: loadn-ai contributors
    website: 'https://github.com/loadn-ai'
identifier: loadn
repository-code: 'https://github.com/loadn-ai/loadn'
url: 'https://github.com/loadn-ai/loadn'
abstract: >-
  A self-contained coding-agent engine in pure Python (single runtime
  dependency: httpx), speaking the Claude Code stream-json dialect so
  existing harnesses can drive it as a drop-in subprocess engine. Ships
  with a FastAPI multi-agent platform (loadn-web) implementing a
  framework-native seven-layer defense-in-depth execution-security stack
  (credential vault, bash-AST policy, egress allowlist proxy, filesystem
  sandbox, irreversible-action approval gate, canary + audit chain,
  supply-chain trust gate), a standing-layer resource console (accounts,
  egress, budgets, channels), and a local-first toolbelt design. Companion
  reference system for three preprints on agent execution security, the
  standing layer, and toolbelt richness (2026, to appear).
keywords:
  - agent
  - llm
  - coding-agent
  - claude-code
  - mcp
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.6.16
date-released: '2026-09-29'
